    "CoiStatement": "The iPad app described in this article has been licensed by a commercial developer and is now available as a free version on the Apple App Store and also as a priced \u2018Pro\u2019 version. Dr Fletcher-Watson, Professor Pain and Professor McConachie may receive royalty payments in future if downloads of the Pro version exceed a certain threshold.",
